   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Structure and use of the Vorgangspassiv in the present",
     "texto": [
      "The process passive (**Vorgangspassiv**) is formed with the auxiliary verb **werden** conjugated in the present and the **Partizip II** of the main verb in last position:",
      "1. Main clause: **Die Pakete werden heute gepackt** (the parcels are packed today / are being packed today).",
      "2. Conjugation of **werden**: ich werde, du wirst, er/sie/es wird, wir werden, ihr werdet, sie/Sie werden.",
      "3. In subordinate clauses (with **weil, dass, wenn**), the conjugated «werden» moves to the very end, after the participle: **...weil die Ware sofort verschickt wird**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Subject",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "werden",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
